uzong:p030","quote":"膠東康王"}],"family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong","source_id":"s-shiji-059-wuzong","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:p001","quote":"孝景皇帝子凡十三人為王，而母五人，同母者為宗親。栗姬子曰榮、德、閼于。程姬子曰餘、非、端。賈夫人子曰彭祖、勝。唐姬子曰發。王夫人兒姁子曰越、寄、乘、舜。","source_term":"孝景皇帝子凡十三人為王"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-shiji059-021","interpretation_note":"以此受傳正文的明示近親主張配置局部家族；不合併跨篇候選身份、不補闕名世代，不表示遠祖世系已核實。分支字元不是長幼排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","parent_person_id":"1c8_u63_bk4"},"id_aliases":["cbr-p003600"]},{"id":"1c8_u63_bk4_KB","label":"六安慶（五宗世家候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"慶","mention_ids":["c-shiji-059-wuzong:m028-0112","c-shiji-059-wuzong:m028-0154"]},{"surface":"六安王","mention_ids":["c-shiji-059-wuzong:m028-0162","c-shiji-059-wuzong:m030-0017"]},{"surface":"六安王慶","mention_ids":["c-shiji-059-wuzong:m030-0000"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:m028-0112","chapter_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:p028","quote":"慶"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:m028-0154","chapter_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:p028","quote":"慶"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:m028-0162","chapter_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:p028","quote":"六安王"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:m030-0000","chapter_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:p030","quote":"六安王慶"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:m030-0017","chapter_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:p030","quote":"六安王"}],"family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong","source_id":"s-shiji-059-wuzong","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:p028","quote":"膠東康王寄，以孝景中二年用皇子為膠東王。二十八年卒。淮南王謀反時，寄微聞其事，私作樓車鏃矢戰守備，候淮南之起。及吏治淮南之事，辭出之。寄於上最親，意傷之，發病而死，不敢置後，於是上（問）［聞］。寄有長子者名賢，母無寵；少子名慶，母愛幸，寄常欲立之，為不次，因有過，遂無言。上憐之，乃以賢為膠東王奉康王嗣，而封慶於故衡山地，為六安王。","source_term":"少子名慶"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-shiji059-038","interpretation_note":"以此受傳正文的明示近親主張配置局部家族；不合併跨篇候選身份、不補闕名世代，不表示遠祖世系已核實。分支字元不是長幼排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","parent_person_id":"1c8_u63_bk4_K"},"id_aliases":["cbr-p003621"]}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-shiji-059-wuzong","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-059","chapter_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong","mention_count":5,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-059-wuzong:m028-0112","c-shiji-059-wuzong:m028-0154","c-shiji-059-wuzong:m028-0162","c-shiji-059-wuzong:m030-0000","c-shiji-059-wuzong:m030-0017"],"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-059-wuzong:p028","c-shiji-059-wuzong:p030"],"passage_count":2}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-shiji-059-wuzong"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"currently_annotated_mentions","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-shiji059-038","subject_person_id":"1c8_u63_bk4_KB","predicate":"father","object_person_id":"1c8_u63_bk4_K","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong","source_id":"s-shiji-059-wuzong","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:p028","quote":"膠東康王寄，以孝景中二年用皇子為膠東王。二十八年卒。淮南王謀反時，寄微聞其事，私作樓車鏃矢戰守備，候淮南之起。及吏治淮南之事，辭出之。寄於上最親，意傷之，發病而死，不敢置後，於是上（問）［聞］。寄有長子者名賢，母無寵；少子名慶，母愛幸，寄常欲立之，為不次，因有過，遂無言。上憐之，乃以賢為膠東王奉康王嗣，而封慶於故衡山地，為六安王。"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"少子名慶","historicity":"historical_tradition"},"interpretation_note":"依明示子、生、母與局部世系主語保存，不因繼位或太子稱本身補父子，不補未名成員及同父同母。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong","source_id":"s-shij